or to PHP 8.0.0, false was returned and a E_WARNING emitted instead. /","params":[{"name":"stream","declared_type":"resource","description":"&fs.file.pointer;"},{"name":"format","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"","declared_type":null,"description":null}],"return_type":"int","var_type":null,"throws":["\\ValueError","\\ArgumentCountError"],"deprecated":null},"availability":{"since":null,"until":null},"is_static":false},{"name":"fputcsv","fqn":"fputcsv","kind":"Function","origin":"PhpRuntime","extension":"standard","location":{"file":"standard/standard_6.php","range":{"start":23701,"end":23708}},"declared_type":null,"signature":{"parameters":[{"name":"stream","declared_type":null,"phpdoc_type":"resource","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"fields","declared_type":"array","phpdoc_type":"array","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"separator","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":true,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"enclosure","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":true,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"escape","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":true,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"eol","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":true,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false}],"declared_return_type":"int|false","phpdoc_return_type":"int|false"},"documentation":{"description":"Format line as CSV and write to file pointer An array of values. </p> The optional delimiter parameter sets the field delimiter (one character only). </p> The optional enclosure parameter sets the field enclosure (one character only). </p> The optional escape_char parameter sets the escape character (one character only). </p> /","params":[{"name":"stream","declared_type":"resource","description":"The file pointer must be valid, and must point to a file successfully opened by fopen() or fsockopen() (and