hing the given search criteria A string, delimited by spaces, in which the following keywords are allowed. Any multi-word arguments (e.g. FROM \"joey smith\") must be quoted. Results will match all <i>criteria</i> entries. ALL - return all messages matching the rest of the criteria</p> Valid values for <i>options</i> are <b>SE_UID</b>, which causes the returned array to contain UIDs instead of messages sequence numbers. </p> <p> Return <b>FALSE</b> if it does not understand the search <i>criteria</i> or no messages have been found. </p> /","params":[{"name":"imap","declared_type":"resource","description":null},{"name":"criteria","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"flags","declared_type":"int","description":"[optional] <p>"},{"name":"charset","declared_type":"string","description":null}],"return_type":"array|false","var_type":null,"throws":[],"deprecated":null},"availability":{"since":null,"until":null},"is_static":false},{"name":"imap_set_quota","fqn":"imap_set_quota","kind":"Function","origin":"PhpRuntime","extension":"imap","location":{"file":"imap/imap.php","range":{"start":47194,"end":47208}},"declared_type":null,"signature":{"parameters":[{"name":"imap","declared_type":null,"phpdoc_type":"resource","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"quota_root","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"mailbox_size","declared_type":"int","phpdoc_type":"int","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false}],"declared_return_type":"bool","phpdoc_return_type":"bool"},"documentation":{"description":"Sets a quota for a given mailbox The mailbox to have a quota set. This should follow the IMAP standard format for a mailbox: user.name. </p> The maximum size (in KB) for the <i>quota_root</i> </p> /","params":[{"name":"imap","declared_type":"resource","description":null},{"name":"quota_root","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"mailbox_size","d