y qualifier. </p> The foreign key owner. </p> The foreign key table. </p> <p> The result set has the following columns: PKTABLE_QUALIFIER PKTABLE_OWNER PKTABLE_NAME PKCOLUMN_NAME FKTABLE_QUALIFIER FKTABLE_OWNER FKTABLE_NAME FKCOLUMN_NAME KEY_SEQ UPDATE_RULE DELETE_RULE FK_NAME PK_NAME </p> <p> If <i>pk_table</i> contains a table name, <b>odbc_foreignkeys</b> returns a result set containing the primary key of the specified table and all of the foreign keys that refer to it. If <i>fk_table</i> contains a table name, <b>odbc_foreignkeys</b> returns a result set containing all of the foreign keys in the specified table and the primary keys (in other tables) to which they refer. If both <i>pk_table</i> and <i>fk_table</i> contain table names, <b>odbc_foreignkeys</b> returns the foreign keys in the table specified in <i>fk_table</i> that refer to the primary key of the table specified in <i>pk_table</i> </p> /","params":[{"name":"odbc","declared_type":"Odbc\\Connection|resource","description":"<p>The ODBC connection identifier,"},{"name":"pk_catalog","declared_type":"string|null","description":"<p>"},{"name":"pk_schema","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"pk_table","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"fk_catalog","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"fk_schema","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"},{"name":"fk_table","declared_type":"string","description":"<p>"}],"return_type":"Odbc\\Result|resource|false","var_type":null,"throws":[],"deprecated":null},"availability":{"since":null,"until":null},"is_static":false},{"name":"odbc_free_result","fqn":"odbc_free_result","kind":"Function","origin":"PhpRuntime","extension":"odbc","location":{"file":"odbc/odbc.php","range":{"start":15459,"end":15475}},"declared_type":null,"signature":{"parameters":[{"name":"statement","declared_type":null,"phpdoc_type":"Odbc\\Result|resource","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false}],"declared_return_type":null,"phpdoc_re