 single character). </p> The name. Accepts search patterns ('%' to match zero or more characters and '_' to match a single character). </p> If <i>table_type</i> is not an empty string, it must contain a list of comma-separated values for the types of interest; each value may be enclosed in single quotes (') or unquoted. For example, \"'TABLE','VIEW'\" or \"TABLE, VIEW\". If the data source does not support a specified table type, <b>odbc_tables</b> does not return any results for that type. </p> or <b>FALSE</b> on failure. <p> The result set has the following columns: TABLE_QUALIFIER TABLE_OWNER TABLE_NAME TABLE_TYPE REMARKS </p> /","params":[{"name":"odbc","declared_type":"Odbc\\Connection|resource","description":"<p>The ODBC connection identifier,"},{"name":"catalog","declared_type":"string|null","description":"[optional] <p>"},{"name":"schema","declared_type":"string|null","description":"[optional] <p>"},{"name":"table","declared_type":"string|null","description":"[optional] <p>"},{"name":"types","declared_type":"string|null","description":"[optional] <p>"}],"return_type":"Odbc\\Result|resource|false","var_type":null,"throws":[],"deprecated":null},"availability":{"since":null,"until":null},"is_static":false},{"name":"opcache_compile_file","fqn":"opcache_compile_file","kind":"Function","origin":"PhpRuntime","extension":"Zend OPcache","location":{"file":"Zend OPcache/OPcache.php","range":{"start":518,"end":538}},"declared_type":null,"signature":{"parameters":[{"name":"filename","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false}],"declared_return_type":"bool","phpdoc_return_type":"bool"},"documentation":{"description":"(PHP 5 &gt;= 5.5.5, PECL ZendOpcache &gt;= 7.0.2 )<br/> Compiles and caches a PHP script without executing it Returns <b>TRUE</b> if the opcode cache for <em>script</em> was invalidated or if there was nothing to invalidate, or <b>FALSE</b> if the opcode cache is disabled. /","params":[{"name":"file