A20POLY1305_TAG_PUSH: indicates that the message marks the end of a set of messages, but not the end of the stream. For example, a huge JSON string sent as multiple chunks can use this tag to indicate to the application that the string is complete and that it can be decoded. But the stream itself is not closed, and more data may follow. SODIUM_CRYPTO_SECRETSTREAM_XCHACHA20POLY1305_TAG_REKEY: \"forget\" the key used to encrypt this message and the previous ones, and derive a new secret key. /","params":[{"name":"state","declared_type":"string","description":"See sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_init_pull and"},{"name":"ciphertext","declared_type":"string","description":"The ciphertext chunk to decrypt."},{"name":"additional_data","declared_type":"string","description":"Optional additional data to include in the authentication tag."}],"return_type":"array|false","var_type":null,"throws":[],"deprecated":null},"availability":{"since":null,"until":null},"is_static":false},{"name":"sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_push","fqn":"sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_push","kind":"Function","origin":"PhpRuntime","extension":"sodium","location":{"file":"sodium/sodium.php","range":{"start":47294,"end":47343}},"declared_type":null,"signature":{"parameters":[{"name":"state","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":true},{"name":"message","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":false,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"additional_data","declared_type":"string","phpdoc_type":"string","optional":true,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false},{"name":"tag","declared_type":"int","phpdoc_type":"int","optional":true,"variadic":false,"by_reference":false}],"declared_return_type":"string","phpdoc_return_type":"string"},"documentation":{"description":"Encrypt a chunk of data so that it can safely be decrypted in a streaming API sodium_crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305_ini